WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.472
Logging for Studio 3.

2
00:00:01.752 --> 00:00:10.584
Studio 3’s harness will replay your eval set, compute retrieval and answer metrics, run judges for support, and produce failure histograms.

3
